  "notes": "{講演|こうえん} is a formal lecture or speech given to an audience, typically on academic or professional topics.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n- Pattern: {講演|こうえん}する\n\nWORD FORMATION:\n{講|こう} (lecture) + {演|えん} (perform/speak)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {講演|こうえん}をする: to give a lecture\n- {講演|こうえん}を{行|おこな}う: to deliver a lecture (formal)\n- {講演|こうえん}を{聞|き}く: to attend a lecture\n- {講演|こうえん}{会|かい}: lecture event\n- {講演|こうえん}{者|しゃ}: lecturer, speaker\n- {講演|こうえん}{料|りょう}: lecture fee\n- {基調|きちょう}{講演|こうえん}: keynote speech\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {演説|えんぜつ}: speech (often political)\n- {発表|はっぴょう}: presentation\n- {授業|じゅぎょう}: class, lesson",
